---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy · Nrvana Studio">
  <section class="section pt-20 pb-20 max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm" style="color: var(--color-ink-mute);">Effective June 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8" style="color: var(--color-ink-soft);">

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">The short version</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with anyone. We do not use tracking cookies. We do not retain your work beyond the scope of your project. For artists: your work is never used to train AI models, and it is never included as training data in any deliverable we produce for you or anyone else.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">What we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">When you contact us or book a call, we receive your name and email address. If you become a client, we may receive visual assets, brand references, and context about your work. We collect only what we need to do good work for you.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">This website uses a privacy-friendly analytics tool that counts page visits without fingerprinting users or setting tracking cookies. We see aggregate numbers only.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">How we use it</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Contact information is used to reply to you and manage your project. Nothing else. We do not use your email for marketing unless you have explicitly asked for it.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Visual assets, brand files, and any creative work you share with us are used solely to complete your engagement. They are not shown to other clients, shared with third parties, or used for any other purpose.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">AI tools and your work</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We use AI tools to help produce your deliverables. When we do, we configure those tools with your specific context and do not share your work with other users of those platforms. We use AI tools under terms that prohibit using inputs for model training. Your work does not feed any model.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">For artists especially: your style, samples, and references remain yours. We treat them with the same confidentiality as any proprietary creative asset.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">Third-party tools</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We use a scheduling tool for booking calls and standard email to communicate. These have their own privacy policies. We do not use advertising platforms, social tracking pixels, or data brokers.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">You can ask us at any time what information we hold, request corrections, or ask us to delete it. We will respond within seven days. Email <a href="mailto:hi@nrvana.com" class="underline underline-offset-4">hi@nrvana.com</a> with the subject line "Privacy request."</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-ink);">Questions</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Write to us at <a href="mailto:hi@nrvana.com" class="underline underline-offset-4">hi@nrvana.com</a>. We answer personally.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
